"P1296562932" "So, Officer {LAST_NAME} took a bribe from the Lost, then double-crossed them. No wonder they went after him! Only one thing troubles me: {LAST_NAME} said that the Lost wanted him to overlook their raid on a munitions factory. All we've ever seen from the Lost is random violence and chaos. Could it be that there is actually a method to their madness?"
// RandomFameString :
"P2737650015" "{HeroName} might be up for a commendation from the Paragon City police."

