// Clue Name :
"P751734876" "List of locations"
// DetailString :
"P2801360734" "You found this list on one of the Lost you defeated. It lists several locations, including a bank, a water purification facility, and a military depot."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1836522429" "I'm beginning to think that the Lost may be targeting their violent attacks on specific businesses and facilities. I'm hoping you can help me learn more. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to hit the streets and look for clues to the Lost's plans.</A> If I'm right, there's much more to the Lost than meets the eye."
// AcceptString :
"P2414337949" "Hit the streets and look for clues to the Lost's plans"
// SendOffString :
"P3810000947" "You can find large concentrations of Lost in Boomtown or Skyway City. You should start looking for clues there."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2475026815" "Seek clues to Lost's plans"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P721423748" "We still don't know what the Lost may be planning."

