// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P237494121" "Since the Lost are Paragon City citizens, I'd like you to use this Plasmatic Taser. That way you won't do any permanent harm."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P334222339" "On one of the Lost, you found a list of locations."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4060791463" "{HeroName}, I have never been sorrier to be proven right. It looks like the Lost really are targeting specific locations for their attacks. They also attack a lot of unimportant sites, in order to make their raids seem random. But there's no doubt about it: there's a calculating mind guiding the Lost. We need to find out what its ultimate goals are."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL3_TheLost_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1473935369" "I guess you've seen those Lost rectors preaching about their new order? It seems like the entire group is some sort of religious cult. In Skyway City, they've started swaying a lot of the homeless to their cause. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to get over to Skyway City and take down a few of the Lost.</A> Maybe we can convince the rest of the homeless not to join up."
// AcceptString :
"P1311173018" "Go to Skyway City and take down a few Lost"
// SendOffString :
"P3111684818" "You can find Lost pretty easily in the Gruff or the Land of the Lost."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1847932477" "Combat Lost in Skyway City"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3364688253" "The Lost are still getting a lot of new recruits from Skyway City. I need you to do something about that."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3321906165" "You have discouraged the homeless in Skyway City from joining the Lost."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2540709109" "Many of the homeless are desperate for a little comfort; it's easy to see how they can be swayed by the rhetoric of the Lost. But I think you showed them that the Lost are on the wrong side of the law in Paragon City. Combined with the City Council's new outreach program, your efforts may keep a lot of the homeless from wandering down a dangerous path."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL3_TheLost_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3196811205" "I'm sending you out on a mission of mercy today, {HeroName}. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to get over to Skyway City and take some of the Lost into custody.</A> If our doctors can examine them in person, they may be able to figure out how to reverse the process that has altered the Lost so drastically."
// AcceptString :
"P1666891910" "Go to Skyway City and take some of the Lost into custody"
// SendOffString :
"P501608157" "In addition to helping these people, you should be able to alleviate the chaos in Skyway City. Typical Lost hangouts are Hide Park and the Land of the Lost."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3867110545" "Arrest Lost in Skyway City"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3440504691" "I need you to take a few more Lost into custody. With enough data, the doctors may be able to help those poor people."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P725363409" "You have taken 15 Lost into custody."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1848714882" "Thanks, {HeroName}. With any luck, we'll be able to help reverse the process that has turned these people into the Lost."
